Subject: [PATCH] fixes

(colorsos 15 rebuild of the equivalent 16.0.10.500 fix set; UxThreadPool
and consumer/apsAdapter/ALog do not exist in the A15 sdk jar, their
hunks were dropped. A15's HdrTransformPlatform only has sLibraryLoaded
as an explicit `= false` initializer; sAlgoExists is already implicit.)

